@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Read profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Save a name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal": "tiger", "korean_name": "양자"}

### Skip name
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"animal": "tiger", "korean_name": ""}

### My page (profile + progress and stamps per category)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/me/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
